      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "不同的体积。当温度一定时，气体的压强随着它的体积增大",
        "而降低，因此，在图上相应于大体积 $V_2$ 的等容线，低于相应于",
        "体积 $V_1<V_2$ 的等容线。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "所有的直线都通过点 $O$。就是说，在绝对零度时，理想气",
        "体的压强和体积一样都等于零。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "请大家自己证明查理定律可以写成如下形式",
        "$p=p_0\\gamma T$，　（2-22）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式中 $p_0$——当温度 $T=273\\mathrm{K}$ 时气体的压强，$\\gamma$ 叫做气体压强",
        "温度系数，等于体胀系数："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\gamma\\approx\\frac{1}{273}$度$^{-1}=\\alpha$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "系数 $\\gamma$ 是当气体温度升高 $1$ 度时压强的相对变化量。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "请根据门捷列夫-克拉珀龙方程（2-19），求得玻义耳-马",
        "略特定律（2-2）和盖·吕萨克定律（2-7）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "19. 在工程技术中所利用的气体性质"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在许多工程技术设备中都利用气体具有的一系列性质。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "实际中应用的气体的所有特性，都可以从状态方程（2-19）",
        "得出。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "气体——被压缩的弹性体　正如从状态方程得出的，气",
        "体对器壁的压强"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$p=\\frac{m}{\\mu}\\cdot\\frac{RT}{V}$。　（2-23）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "只有当 $m\\to0$（几乎没有气体）或 $V\\to\\infty$（气体无限地膨胀），以",
        "及 $T\\to0$（气体的分子不运动）时，才没有压强。"
      ]
    },
